\ tools/fmt.1z - Format a 1z source file with the 1z formatter and print the result
\
\ Usage: 1z tools/fmt.1z FILE
\
\ A driver for the build system while `1z fmt` still runs the Zig formatter. Once
\ the subcommand calls `lib/formatter.1z`, this goes away.

use "formatter" ;

command-line-args #first format-file print
